<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῡρός</span></b>  (in dialects also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπυρός</span></b>  (q. v.)), ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wheat, Triticum
			vulgare</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελίφρονα, μελιηδέα
			πυρόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.188
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.569
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ πυρὸν ἄλεσσαν</span>
			ground <i>it</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.109
			</span></i>; given to geese, <i><span class="en">
				19.536
			</span></i>: pl., with other grains, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροί τε ζειαί τε ἰδ᾽ εὐρυφυὲς κρῖ
					λευκόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.604
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροὶ καὶ κριθαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.110
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				19.112
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.76.38
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1405
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				1145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				580
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.85
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a grain of wheat</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἑνὸς πυροῦ εἷς πυθμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					728b35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>in Hes.</u>
				84
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἄγριος</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδόνιον τὸ μικρόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.181
			</span></i>. (Cf. Lith. <i>pūraĩ</i> (pl.)
			'wheat', and perh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρήν</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
